WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.347 --> 00:00:04.085
(frenetic woodwind orchestral music)

00:00:04.085 --> 00:00:08.168
(quick oboe and plucked strings)

00:00:10.428 --> 00:00:13.678
(whining string music)

00:00:14.737 --> 00:00:16.687
- [Voiceover] This is Justin Schmidt.

00:00:16.687 --> 00:00:18.350
- Yeah, my name is Justin Schmidt.

00:00:18.350 --> 00:00:19.976
- [Voiceover] He's an entomologist.

00:00:19.976 --> 00:00:21.724
- And I'm an entomologist.

00:00:21.724 --> 00:00:25.255
I basically study stinging insects.

00:00:25.255 --> 00:00:28.338
- [Voiceover] He's been
stung by a lot of insects.

00:00:28.338 --> 00:00:31.551
- I've probably been stung
at least 1,000 times.

00:00:31.551 --> 00:00:33.542
- [Voiceover] He reviews
insect stings the way

00:00:33.542 --> 00:00:35.612
a sommelier reviews wine.

00:00:35.612 --> 00:00:38.564
- Pure, intense, brilliant
pain, like walking

00:00:38.564 --> 00:00:41.326
over flaming charcoal
with a three inch nail

00:00:41.326 --> 00:00:42.631
embedded in your heel.

00:00:42.631 --> 00:00:44.179
- [Voiceover] Which insect was that?

00:00:44.179 --> 00:00:46.012
- That's a bullet ant.

00:00:47.106 --> 00:00:50.724
- [Voiceover] This is his lab in Tucson.

00:00:50.724 --> 00:00:53.043
This is his harvester ant.

00:00:53.043 --> 00:00:55.570
This is his vinegaroon.

00:00:55.570 --> 00:00:58.496
This is his tarantula hawk.

00:00:58.496 --> 00:01:01.871
These are some more harvester ants
in a park, near his lab.

00:01:01.871 --> 00:01:04.310
He is the creator of
the Schmidt Pain Scale.

00:01:04.310 --> 00:01:06.951
- The Schmidt Pain Scale
is basically a scale

00:01:06.951 --> 00:01:09.510
to rate the painfulness
of stinging insects

00:01:09.510 --> 00:01:11.382
on a scale of one to four.

00:01:11.382 --> 00:01:13.191
A one would be a sweat bee.

00:01:13.191 --> 00:01:15.914
Two would be something
like a yellow jacket wasp.

00:01:15.914 --> 00:01:18.761
A three would be something
like a harvester ant.

00:01:18.761 --> 00:01:21.283
And a four would be a tarantula hawk.

00:01:21.283 --> 00:01:23.346
- [Voiceover] How bad is a four?

00:01:23.346 --> 00:01:26.829
- Four is absolutely,
excruciatingly debilitating,

00:01:26.829 --> 00:01:30.611
incapacitating, just shuts
you down, just absolute,

00:01:30.611 --> 00:01:33.575
sheer pain, there's just nothing you can

00:01:33.575 --> 00:01:35.768
really do about that.

00:01:35.768 --> 00:01:38.123
I don't think I'd wanna
be stung by a whole bunch

00:01:38.123 --> 00:01:39.422
of different fours.

00:01:39.422 --> 00:01:42.306
I don't think I could
endure that for very long.

00:01:42.306 --> 00:01:44.218
- [Voiceover] Let's be
clear, Justin Schmidt doesn't

00:01:44.218 --> 00:01:46.618
just go out and get stung on purpose.

00:01:46.618 --> 00:01:49.826
It's just that he's dedicated
his life to studying, well.

00:01:49.826 --> 00:01:52.390
- My passion is insects,
and stinging insects

00:01:52.390 --> 00:01:53.686
in particular.

00:01:53.686 --> 00:01:54.784
Yeah, I get stung.

00:01:54.784 --> 00:01:57.142
But that's, that's all
just part of the passion

00:01:57.142 --> 00:01:59.299
you know, that gives me data.

00:01:59.299 --> 00:02:01.736
You know, a sting helps
me in understanding

00:02:01.736 --> 00:02:04.056
what the insect's doing
and I get to be out

00:02:04.056 --> 00:02:06.293
in the sunshine, and out in the rain,

00:02:06.293 --> 00:02:08.974
out in the environment
studying these magnificent,

00:02:08.974 --> 00:02:10.474
beautiful insects.

00:02:11.370 --> 00:02:13.445
It's just, just such a joy.

00:02:13.445 --> 00:02:16.169
I can't imagine anything
I'd rather do more.

00:02:16.169 --> 00:02:20.336
(pounding, orchestra and piano music)

00:02:21.348 --> 00:02:23.431
(chimes)

